  "description": "Oh Yoonsang has been cast in N-flix Korea’s new drama, ‘Aftermath’. His character’s love interest is Jeong Do-hwan, a genius actor from the independent film scene whom he has secretly admired. However, when they actually meet, he turns out to be a man who is completely impossible to figure out…?! Yoonsang, a hopeless romantic, finds himself completely at the mercy of Do-hwan—a free spirit who is playful yet serious, affectionate yet rude—rendering his nickname “Prince Alpha” utterly meaningless. Yoonsang may have the reputation of a Hollywood Casanova, but he’s determined to make Do-hwan beg for him!\nSource: MU",
